  (text "Address / status shift registers: SPI shifts while latch stays LOW" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 28 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid "255059ef-716a-5693-9ab2-4ba9f1074056"))
  (text "Send U4 byte first, U3 byte second, U2 byte last; MSB first.\nU2 Q0-Q7 = A0-A7; U3 Q0-Q7 = A8-A15.\nStage 2: U4 Q0-Q3 = A16-A19; Q4/Q5/Q6 = active-low R/G/B.\nOE# = GND and SRCLR# = +5V on every 595." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 140 0) (effects (font (size 1.25 1.25)) (justify left)) (uuid "b6142052-acaa-5fc1-8dc7-c71b424bd317"))
  (text "Direct socket U6 is dedicated to NM27C512.\nOne target only: socket OR adapter.\nPin 20 = CE/PGM#; pin 22 = OE/VPP via K1.\nREAD: +5V, OE logic. PROG: +6.25V, switched VPP.\nDo not insert/remove a target with USB or VPP connected." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 264 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left)) (uuid "bde601d3-0248-5d37-bdcd-4c8152dd62d0"))
